# .publicignore
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Blocklist consumed by the /mirror-public skill via `rsync --exclude-from=`.
# Every pattern here is a path (relative to the repo root) that MUST NEVER be
# copied into the public mirror repo (https://github.com/samwelmunga/jenga-npm).
#
# Policy: over-block, don't under-block. Anything missed is a private leak;
# anything extra is merely an unshipped file. Add new private paths as they
# appear — this file is the single source of truth for public-mirror scope.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Private scrum board (epics, stories, tasks, indices) ---
project/board/

# --- Inter-agent queues (triggers, handoff files, update proposals) ---
project/queue/

# --- Runtime event logs ---
# publish-history.json is the /publish ledger and MUST ship: publishing runs
# from the public repo, so the ledger has to live there. Two rsync rules make
# this work and both are load-bearing: include lines must precede the exclude
# (first match wins), and the directory itself must be included because rsync
# will not descend into an excluded directory to reach a file inside it.
+ project/logs/
+ project/logs/publish-history.json
- project/logs/**

# --- Problem / security / conflict rapports ---
project/rapports/

# --- Top-level todo (working list of pending missions) ---
project/todo.md

# --- Private planning + execution artefacts tied to board items ---
project/documentation/plans/
project/documentation/summaries/
project/instructions/

# --- Secrets / environment files ---
.env
.env.*
*.local
*.pid

# --- Machine-local Jenga runtime state ---
.jenga_paths
.jenga_tmp/
.tmp/

# --- Local Claude / agent session state (never shippable) ---
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/worktrees/
.agents/worktrees/

# --- Private Claude / agent skills ---
skills/mirror-public/
.claude/skills/mirror-public/
.agents/skills/mirror-public/
skills/self-sync/
.claude/skills/self-sync/
.agents/skills/self-sync/
skills/train/
.claude/skills/train/
.agents/skills/train/
skills/strategy/
.claude/skills/strategy/
.agents/skills/strategy/
skills/convert/
.claude/skills/convert/
.agents/skills/convert/
skills/route/
.claude/skills/route/
.agents/skills/route/

# --- Private MCP servers ---
mcp/router/
.claude/mcp/router/
.agents/mcp/router/

# --- Scratch worktree used by /mirror-public itself ---
.mirror-worktrees/

# --- Dev / package noise ---
node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- OS cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Git internals (rsync would otherwise walk the private .git dir) ---
.git/
.jenga-permission-level.json
